<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Face to Sticker</p>
      <h1>Face to Sticker AI Generator</h1>
      <p>
        Upload a portrait and turn it into a clean sticker-style image. The face to sticker tool
        checks your account credits, starts generation automatically, and keeps the result in your
        sticker history.
      </p>
      <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#upload">Upload a Face</a>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>How face to sticker works</h2>
        <p>
          Choose a portrait, add an optional prompt, and the generator creates a stylized sticker
          with a clear subject and sticker-friendly presentation.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Best portrait tips</h2>
        <p>
          Use a bright, front-facing image where the face is easy to see. Avoid heavy blur, cropped
          faces, and very dark lighting.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Download and reuse</h2>
        <p>
          Finished stickers appear in your history, where you can download, save, regenerate, or
          create a variation.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
